{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20047","headline":"赠郑夫子鲂 · 孟郊","name":"赠郑夫子鲂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天地入胸臆，吁嗟生风雷。\n文章得其微，物象由我裁。\n宋玉逞大句，李白飞狂才。\n苟非圣贤心，孰与造化该。\n勉矣郑夫子，骊珠今始胎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20047.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20047","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}